   "text": "儿童政策：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_08661a51d5608f6c1796",
   "sourceHash": "08661a51d5608f6c17960eca35210cc0cec80543798f74c8b1ceb506c3105302",
   "text": "5岁以下儿童与成人同住一间客房并共用现有床铺时，可免费入住及用餐。较大儿童或加床可能需要额外收费。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ebfb19dabf37902c2692",
   "sourceHash": "ebfb19dabf37902c2692a2f90eb22a77c5323423763cbde7e9c8ca6331fd4979",
   "text": "6. 医生问诊时间",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a7659c5df1736378ba48",
   "sourceHash": "a7659c5df1736378ba484d79819ce5005830cb4f31017b6e12e9cf8a5b3a1c1b",
   "text": "当天预订或未经预约直接到达的患者，须在下午3:30前办理入住，方可于当天接受医生问诊。设定这一截止时间，是为了让我们的阿育吠陀医生能够提供详细、从容的问诊。下午3:30之后到达者，其问诊将根据医生的时间安排在下一个可预约日进行。我们建议所有患者合理安排行程，以免延误治疗项目的开始。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guests' rendered as 患者 (patients) per clinical register; 'healing program' rendered as 治疗项目; 'experience' softened."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_20873db7e326c7fb84da",
   "sourceHash": "20873db7e326c7fb84dada7dd093644aad778696e312cb92e3a64a31aeadb5ea",
   "text": "7. 付款条款与方式",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_06b68fd59cee3e1232fa",
   "sourceHash": "06b68fd59cee3e1232fab34dc112881440ca4454280aaf98a7f6d9e1b2d06580",
   "text": "付款方式：患者可通过信用卡/借记卡、银行转账或预订时指定的其他认可方式付款。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guests' rendered as 患者 (patients) per clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3cc11a3c40b1339bf5b3",
   "sourceHash": "3cc11a3c40b1339bf5b3c210755e8014f7aaefb17a9c07386f63bb881efd79b5",
   "text": "付款方式：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e9a9582234afe3f49e05",
   "sourceHash": "e9a9582234afe3f49e057887644c9fa0bb2f0220becfd2647faa0715462b7294",
   "text": "患者可通过信用卡/借记卡、银行转账或预订时指定的其他认可方式付款。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guests' rendered as 患者 (patients) per clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f60c6ca23f88bccbe737",
   "sourceHash": "f60c6ca23f88bccbe737680cf1a223ac2537bd37cb1047d73c5591397493fdce",
   "text": "货币与费用：所有付款均以指定货币处理。任何银行手续费、交易费用或汇率差额均由患者承担。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'the Guest' rendered as 患者 (patient) per clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1df199c15d15143eaa84",
   "sourceHash": "1df199c15d15143eaa8413535c4f5346414c130afe5837f22a851585db413104",
   "text": "货币与费用：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_124030366e0d03e04e95",
   "sourceHash": "124030366e0d03e04e95042e205afbf276f4e8fa51e2fd94efc5a85c2c067092",
   "text": "所有付款均以指定货币处理。任何银行手续费、交易费用或汇率差额均由患者承担。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'the Guest' rendered as 患者 (patient) per clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ef082a6037a3b0a79b32",
   "sourceHash": "ef082a6037a3b0a79b32fa64353b50f7b49d554c73acea34b54f4e7a9e6b4e16",
   "text": "8. 价格、优惠及税费",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_afb0ea0a6350125b18bf",
   "sourceHash": "afb0ea0a6350125b18bf6bd2daedfac8a14789301a9a7a20288179aa1f3111c4",
   "text": "价格：所有费率和收费以预订时公布的为准。我们保留在不事先通知的情况下调整价格、促销活动和套餐的权利，但相关变更不会影响已确认的预订。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d15792fe95739fc178d2",
   "sourceHash": "d15792fe95739fc178d2e0ff4869378cd8b40b6136b07d83e345448d2ae32299",
   "text": "价格：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_aa732602857428527663",
   "sourceHash": "aa7326028574285276636d6f7393634f9d9bbc4ffc3d009b994c6d183550395a",
   "text": "所有费率和收费以预订时公布的为准。我们保留在不事先通知的情况下调整价格、促销活动和套餐的权利，但相关变更不会影响已确认的预订。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_953128a42c11a47cb97a",
   "sourceHash": "953128a42c11a47cb97a9df45246a0b0b69fbd94592f121ad1d20bcb6b49f493",
   "text": "税费及规费：所有适用税费、政府规费及服务费将依法加入账单。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b5d61d85e4dfc98cbbf9",
   "sourceHash": "b5d61d85e4dfc98cbbf9b7f451427200f3ab827ec2275f747618f88440d354c7",
   "text": "税费及规费：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_06a7eeaffe8a83a25811",
   "sourceHash": "06a7eeaffe8a83a25811640e67d7a3fe85077effd986ed1524690b397849a746",
   "text": "所有适用税费、政府规费及服务费将依法加入账单。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_050756c2c76bc6bdb9c4",
   "sourceHash": "050756c2c76bc6bdb9c424b19a204ef5ae9d98b68525ddc41af399c1edf69160",
   "text": "9. 取消、变更及退款政策",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9eb66d8db6a3ae4a947d",
   "sourceHash": "9eb66d8db6a3ae4a947dbe8bf85b0bca41cecb42cca753302d758db37a6a7379",
   "text": "取消时限：入院前30天以上取消：全额退款。入院前15至30天取消：退还已付金额的50%，并扣除适用的交易费用和税费。入院前不足15天取消，或在住院期间更改日期：不予退款。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cc0af2857884fbc11d1e",
   "sourceHash": "cc0af2857884fbc11d1e3b7659de8757cd349a9259171dd229a5c0eee4d43ce9",
   "text": "变更：更改预订日期、治疗项目或房型须视情况而定，并可能产生额外费用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_93a7da14f78ec4137e88",
   "sourceHash": "93a7da14f78ec4137e88c74e34e3fe212086b22b177f895b389b3107ac3aa77e",
   "text": "变更：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bcf3065d91ff1f43cfba",
   "sourceHash": "bcf3065d91ff1f43cfbad030c1b83a2afbe554825aa52e25c5b4dd4592c153d0",
   "text": "更改预订日期、治疗项目或房型须视情况而定，并可能产生额外费用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a8c2638aab5b5a5dc437",
   "sourceHash": "a8c2638aab5b5a5dc4375421aaac53bb2e9bae16965cdabf7df0f20ba627a0a5",
   "text": "退款流程：经批准的退款将在合理时间内，按原交易所用的付款方式办理。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
